  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Slice cucumber into thin sticks. Grate carrot.\n• In a large bowl, combine carrot and salad leaves. Drizzle with white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735665369cbcaefd20473/step-42be3900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring regularly until softened, 5-6 mins. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Stir in the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735665369cbcaefd20473/step-8d851e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry with paper towel, then cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, chermoula spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• Wipe out the frying pan and heat over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Drizzle with the honey and toss to coat. Remove pan from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735665369cbcaefd20473/step-170d6820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Build tacos by spreading a layer of the mayonnaise on each tortilla.\n• Top with salad, caramelised onion, cucumber and haloumi to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b735665369cbcaefd20473/step-8d151d30.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
